@{ ViewBag.Title = "Privacy notice"; }
<div class="page-head"><div class="wrap"><h1>Privacy notice</h1></div></div>
<div class="content wrap prose">
  <p>Hope &amp; Paws Animal Shelter processes personal information in line with South Africa's Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA).</p>
  <h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;">What we collect</h2>
  <p>Only what we need: your name, email and phone number for your account; the answers on an adoption application; donation amounts; and, for volunteers, shifts and hours worked.</p>
  <h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;">Why we use it</h2>
  <p>To process adoption applications, send receipts and updates, run the volunteer roster, and report totals (never personal details) to our funders. We never sell or share your information with third parties.</p>
  <h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;">How we protect it</h2>
  <p>All traffic is encrypted (HTTPS), passwords are stored as salted hashes, data is encrypted at rest, and only staff who need it can see your details.</p>
  <h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;">Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can view and correct your details and download a copy of everything we hold about you from <a href="/Account/Me">My account</a>. To ask for your data to be deleted, contact the shelter manager.</p>
</div>
